WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.456 --> 00:00:03.457
Hello. [s@Hello.

2
00:00:03.497 --> 00:00:04.417
Who are you?

3
00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:06.918
I'm a turkey vulture.

4
00:00:06.978 --> 00:00:12.861
We are raptors.

5
00:00:13.221 --> 00:00:17.983
Raptors are birds that hunt for food.

6
00:00:31.808 --> 00:00:32.909
Where do you live?

7
00:00:34.429 --> 00:00:36.230
We live in North America.

8
00:00:38.391 --> 00:00:40.592
We like open places like fields.

9
00:00:43.773 --> 00:00:44.853
What do you eat?

10
00:00:46.314 --> 00:00:48.495
Turkey vultures eat dead animals.

11
00:00:50.155 --> 00:00:51.756
We can smell very well.

12
00:00:53.677 --> 00:00:55.117
We smell to find food.

13
00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:05.843
Yikes! You eat dead animals?

14
00:01:07.864 --> 00:01:10.686
Yes. We are a big help to nature.

15
00:01:12.187 --> 00:01:13.968
We clean up fields and roads.

16
00:01:15.589 --> 00:01:18.011
And we never attack living animals.

17
00:01:20.093 --> 00:01:21.373
Do you live alone?

18
00:01:23.215 --> 00:01:27.037
Nope! Turkey vultures often eat together.

19
00:01:28.358 --> 00:01:30.280
We fly and sleep together too.

20
00:01:32.564 --> 00:01:34.405
Your beak looks sharp!

21
00:01:36.006 --> 00:01:37.946
Our beaks are very sharp.

22
00:01:39.687 --> 00:01:40.708
They help us eat.

23
00:01:42.849 --> 00:01:44.769
We can even eat big animals.

24
00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:48.191
Do you build nests?

25
00:01:49.371 --> 00:01:51.072
We don't build real nests.

26
00:01:52.913 --> 00:01:55.074
We look for holes in rocks or logs.

27
00:01:57.035 --> 00:01:59.336
We like old buildings and caves too.

28
00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:02.802
I'm hungry again.

29
00:02:02.822 --> 00:02:09.331
Bye! See you later, Turkey Vulture!
